WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.398
The lasting message is that color deserves the same
equivariance treatment that rotations

00:00:05.478 --> 00:00:07.553
and translations have long enjoyed.

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:12.415
Instead of choosing between exploiting color and
being robust to color changes,

00:00:12.495 --> 00:00:15.678
Color Equivariant Convolutions let a network do both,

00:00:15.758 --> 00:00:21.587
by sharing shape information across the color
spectrum while keeping color in its own dimension.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:26.142
The block plugs into standard architectures, plays
well with augmentation,

00:00:26.222 --> 00:00:30.205
and delivers its largest gains precisely where
color matters most,

00:00:30.285 --> 00:00:33.590
offering a practical route to color-robust recognition.
